### RACSim PSWB01 API Test Suite (REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@aiUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 0. Health Checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 0b. AI Microservice Health
GET {{aiUrl}}/health

### 1. Auth: Candidate Login
# @name candidateLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidate@racsim.ai",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1b. Auth: Expert Login
# @name expertLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "expert@racsim.ai",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1c. Auth: Verify Current User (Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{expertLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Candidate: Upload & Parse CV (Extract Skills & Education)
POST {{baseUrl}}/candidates/cand-001/resume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeText": "Dr. Aarav Sharma. Ph.D. in Computer Science. 5+ years experience. Skills: Python, PyTorch, TensorFlow, Computer Vision, CNN, Vision Transformers, ViT, YOLO, Scikit-Learn, Docker, REST APIs, Git. Projects: Real-time autonomous object detection.",
  "fileName": "aarav_sharma_cv.txt"
}

### 3. Posts: List Job Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### 4. Questions: Recommend Questions based on Candidate Skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/recommend?candidateId=cand-001&stage=BasicTechnical&limit=3

### 5. Board Room: Create Interview Session (Adaptive Mode ON)
# @name createSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/interviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "cand-001",
  "postId": "post-scientist-b-ai",
  "level": "Intermediate",
  "type": "Techno-Managerial",
  "duration": 45,
  "adaptiveMode": true,
  "targetQuestionCount": 5
}

### 6. Board Room: Get Live Session State
GET {{baseUrl}}/interviews/{{createSession.response.body.data.session.id}}

### 7. Board Room: Submit Answer to Current Question
# @name submitAnswer
POST {{baseUrl}}/interviews/{{createSession.response.body.data.session.id}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": "q-01",
  "answerText": "I completed my doctorate in Computer Vision focusing on localized feature representations and deep convolutional networks."
}

### 8. Board Room: Submit Expert Manual Scoring
POST {{baseUrl}}/manual-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answerId": "{{submitAnswer.response.body.data.answerId}}",
  "technicalKnowledge": 95,
  "depthCompleteness": 90,
  "communication": 95,
  "consistency": 92,
  "notes": "Excellent technical articulation of doctoral research."
}

### 9. Board Room: Adaptive Engine - Pull Next Question (Dynamically Leveled)
POST {{baseUrl}}/interviews/{{createSession.response.body.data.session.id}}/next-question

### 10. Board Room: Conclude Interview Session & Generate Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/interviews/{{createSession.response.body.data.session.id}}/finish

### 11. Report: Fetch Existing Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/cand-001/post-scientist-b-ai

### 12. Report: Download Printable Official PDF Evaluation Dossier
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/cand-001/post-scientist-b-ai/pdf

### 13. Admin: Consistency & Bias Audit Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit/expert-consistency
